{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/3b4e8e8cf2bf688b9aea5bcbeef1e06c.avif?t=1768239963\" width=1056 height=185 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/414048dc9f4b42c7111759beab00ba94.avif?t=1768239963\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visitors come in search of Tarot readings. To give the right answer, you\u2019ll need to listen carefully.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every word they speak, every observation you make, holds a fragment of their soul.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of books and magical artifacts, deduce the formula of their soul to understand what they wish to hear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interpret the Tarot. The cards never lie, but each holds three meanings. It\u2019s up to you to read them in a way that fulfils the soul's formula.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conjure a prophecy \u2014 if the Tarot reading is true, their fate will lie in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/c986b091ac8ddb96c3044372d696366e.poster.avif?t=1768239963\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/c986b091ac8ddb96c3044372d696366e.webm?t=1768239963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/c986b091ac8ddb96c3044372d696366e.mp4?t=1768239963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/bcf2eea6abdfc86c95843d7024ac6d4b.avif?t=1768239963\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To figure out what their words mean, you shall\u2026</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consult occult books</strong> filled with fortune-telling secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traverse</strong>\u00a0<strong>the night sky</strong>, unveiling clues hidden among the stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Study </strong>the laws of the Zodiac and the essences of crystals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master a dozen magical artifacts</strong> (mini-games) \u2014 each attuned to specific soul aspects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or\u2026 just ask Prince Mortimer. <i>Nicely</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/3121f855680605aaba945a3144c03c59.avif?t=1768239963\" width=720 height=405 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/807f83d4b225a3e61dacf842a9fe0741.avif?t=1768239963\" width=600 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You never knew her. Only the stories.</i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 {<strong>Intuition 2</strong>}</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>They called her Great Madame Avestari \u2014 reader of fates, mistress of the occult.</i>\u00a0 {<strong>Triumph 3</strong>}</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your grandmother, apparently.</i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 {<strong>Mercy 1</strong>}</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Now the salon is yours.</i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 {<strong>Strength 2</strong>}</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You slip into her shawl and draw the veil, so no one sees your face.</i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 {<strong>Mastery 2}</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You take her name, her tools, her seat behind the curtain.</i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0{<strong>Mastery 3</strong>}</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And wait for the first knock.</i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0{<strong>Chaos 2</strong>} </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/d12fb68b7c85890c03a02bc950c31108.poster.avif?t=1768239963\" width=600 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/d12fb68b7c85890c03a02bc950c31108.webm?t=1768239963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/d12fb68b7c85890c03a02bc950c31108.mp4?t=1768239963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/c309234d6706ab2b91d9ae0c8dd79dc2.avif?t=1768239963\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 hand-written Tarot prophecies, fully voiced in English.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ visitors, each with their own story, secrets, and motives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ intertwining storylines with branching outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Famed figures drawn from the pages of\u00a0literary Victorian London.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 endings shaped by how you read, guide, and deceive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~6 hours for a single playthrough. 10+ hours to uncover every fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/75dee082cae5cf8103867257e0bd4614.webp?t=1768239963\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/75dee082cae5cf8103867257e0bd4614.poster.avif?t=1768239963\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=160 /></picture></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Yes, you can pet the cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*And the toad.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3908130?t=1768239963","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/b334ebf1398c053ec952414312869ffe0f633ed4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768239963","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/d073f0d5ae915a6496763c5c232ea3994d5ec900/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768239963","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/d073f0d5ae915a6496763c5c232ea3994d5ec900/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768239963","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/3b4e8e8cf2bf688b9aea5bcbeef1e06c.avif?t=1768239963\" width=1056 height=185 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/414048dc9f4b42c7111759beab00ba94.avif?t=1768239963\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visitors come in search of Tarot readings. To give the right answer, you\u2019ll need to listen carefully.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every word they speak, every observation you make, holds a fragment of their soul.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of books and magical artifacts, deduce the formula of their soul to understand what they wish to hear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interpret the Tarot. The cards never lie, but each holds three meanings. It\u2019s up to you to read them in a way that fulfils the soul's formula.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conjure a prophecy \u2014 if the Tarot reading is true, their fate will lie in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/c986b091ac8ddb96c3044372d696366e.poster.avif?t=1768239963\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/c986b091ac8ddb96c3044372d696366e.webm?t=1768239963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/c986b091ac8ddb96c3044372d696366e.mp4?t=1768239963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/bcf2eea6abdfc86c95843d7024ac6d4b.avif?t=1768239963\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To figure out what their words mean, you shall\u2026</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consult occult books</strong> filled with fortune-telling secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traverse</strong>\u00a0<strong>the night sky</strong>, unveiling clues hidden among the stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Study </strong>the laws of the Zodiac and the essences of crystals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master a dozen magical artifacts</strong> (mini-games) \u2014 each attuned to specific soul aspects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or\u2026 just ask Prince Mortimer. <i>Nicely</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/3121f855680605aaba945a3144c03c59.avif?t=1768239963\" width=720 height=405 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/807f83d4b225a3e61dacf842a9fe0741.avif?t=1768239963\" width=600 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You never knew her. Only the stories.</i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 {<strong>Intuition 2</strong>}</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>They called her Great Madame Avestari \u2014 reader of fates, mistress of the occult.</i>\u00a0 {<strong>Triumph 3</strong>}</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your grandmother, apparently.</i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 {<strong>Mercy 1</strong>}</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Now the salon is yours.</i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 {<strong>Strength 2</strong>}</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You slip into her shawl and draw the veil, so no one sees your face.</i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 {<strong>Mastery 2}</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You take her name, her tools, her seat behind the curtain.</i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0{<strong>Mastery 3</strong>}</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And wait for the first knock.</i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0{<strong>Chaos 2</strong>} </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/d12fb68b7c85890c03a02bc950c31108.poster.avif?t=1768239963\" width=600 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/d12fb68b7c85890c03a02bc950c31108.webm?t=1768239963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/d12fb68b7c85890c03a02bc950c31108.mp4?t=1768239963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/c309234d6706ab2b91d9ae0c8dd79dc2.avif?t=1768239963\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 hand-written Tarot prophecies, fully voiced in English.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ visitors, each with their own story, secrets, and motives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ intertwining storylines with branching outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Famed figures drawn from the pages of\u00a0literary Victorian London.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 endings shaped by how you read, guide, and deceive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~6 hours for a single playthrough. 10+ hours to uncover every fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/75dee082cae5cf8103867257e0bd4614.webp?t=1768239963\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/extras/75dee082cae5cf8103867257e0bd4614.poster.avif?t=1768239963\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=160 /></picture></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Yes, you can pet the cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*And the toad.</p>","developers":["Antagonist Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908130/66ed4574cb0a80cb8117823ba4973ba24055376f/header.jpg?t=1768239963","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3908130/1019708439/f9b85c5f9455bae89e0734137921a8618400ce04/1757716545/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757719353","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3908130/1019708439/f9b85c5f9455bae89e0734137921a8618400ce04/1757716545/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757719353","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3908130/1019708439/f9b85c5f9455bae89e0734137921a8618400ce04/1757716545/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757719353","id":257197074,"name":"Fortune Teller Simulator Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257197074/62b915bdeaf967fc4bc3c7e0358fab4a558e85cf/movie_600x337.jp